# purpose: part B of the M4 replay pair. Balances, the frozen flag, the sequence number (next is 13)
#          and the transfer tag (next is t3) must all have come back from the journal.
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
TRANSFER alice bob 25
TRANSFER alice carol 1
TRANSFER carol alice 1
UNFREEZE carol
TRANSFER bob alice 100
TRANSFER bob alice 99.5
BALANCE alice
BALANCE bob
BALANCE carol
